        /// Per-hart SSIE enable for secondary harts (perf-sched lane, 2026-10-31).
        ///
        /// `init()` above runs ONCE on the boot hart (main.rs) — but `sie` is a
        /// PER-HART CSR that boot.S explicitly zeroes on every hart's entry, and
